Description: LLM inference engine in Rust
 llama-rs is a Rust implementation of llama.cpp providing high-performance
 inference for large language models. It includes CLI, HTTP server, and
 GUI frontends.
 .
 This package contains the llama-cli, llama-server, and llama-ui binaries.